    "title": "‘The Boys’ Season 5 Episode 3 – release date, schedule, how to watch",
    "text": "\"The Boys\" returns to Prime Video with a two-episode premiere, which landed on the platform on April 8. Featuring returning stars Karl Urban, Jack Quaid, Antony Starr, Erin Moriarty, Jessie T. Usher, Laz Alonso, and Chace Crawford, \"The Boys\" Season 5 will round out the series, which started in 2019.With Homelander reigning terror and Hughie, Mother's Milk, and Frenchie all trapped in a \"Freedom Camp,\" the final season is off to a rocky start – will goodness prevail? Or will terror win out?Erin Moriarty (Annie January aka Starlight), and Laz Alonso (Mother's Milk) in \"The Boys\" Season 5. | Jasper Savage/Prime Video'The Boys' Season 5 Episode 3 Release Date\"The Boys\" Season 5 Episode 3 will be available to stream on Prime Video on April 15, 2026.New episodes of \"The Boys\" Season 5 premiere on Prime Video each Wednesday through May 20, 2026.'The Boys' Season 5 Episode 3 – How to Watch\"The Boys\" Season 5 Episode 3 lands at 12 a.m. PT/3 a.m. ET on Prime Video.A Prime Video subscription is required to watch \"The Boys\" Season 5. Prime Video costs $14.99 per month or $139 annually when included with an Amazon Prime membership, or you can subscribe to the streaming service alone for $8.99 per month.What Time Does 'The Boys' Season 5 Episode 3 Come Out?\"The Boys\" Season 5 Episode 3 will be available on Prime Video from 12 a.m. PT/3 a.m. ET.With the early streaming release in the US, the debut time in other time zones will differ.April 15BRT: 4:00 amBST: 8:00 amCEST: 9:00 amIST: 12:30 pmJST: 4:00 pmAET: 5:00 pmNZDT: 7:00 pmWill There Be 2 Episodes of 'The Boys' This Week?No. Season 5 of \"The Boys\" will kick off with a two-episode premiere, then will continue with regular weekly releases.Will All Episodes of 'The Boys' Season 5 Land at Once?No. New episodes will be released weekly through May 20.'The Boys' Season 5 Release ScheduleEpisode One: April 8Episode Two: April 8Episode Three: April 15Episode Four: April 22Episode Five: April 29Episode Six: May 6Episode Seven: May 13Episode Eight: May 20'The Boys' Season 5 Episode 3 RuntimeIn previous seasons, episodes of \"The Boys\" ran for approximately one hour. The exact runtime for Season 5 Episode 3 is unknown.What Will Happen in 'The Boys' Season 5 Episode 3?Plot details of Episode 3 of \"The Boys\" Season 5 are currently under wraps. However, Amazon MGM Studios has released the official synopsis for Season 5, which reads, \"In the fifth and final season, it's Homelander's world, completely subject to his erratic, egomaniacal whims. Hughie, Mother's Milk, and Frenchie are imprisoned in a \"Freedom Camp.\" Annie struggles to mount a resistance against the overwhelming Supe force. Kimiko is nowhere to be found. But when Butcher reappears, ready and willing to use a virus that will wipe all Supes off the map, he sets in motion a chain of events that will forever change the world and everyone in it. It's the climax, people. Big stuff's gonna happen.\"",
    "word_count": 492,
